      "at": "2026-11-15T11:41:54.589Z",
      "type": "agent_text",
      "text": "I didn't order a dock, because the store can't confirm that any dock under $150 will run two 4K 60 Hz displays from a USB-C port.\n\n- **Demo Dock Duo ($129.00):** The store hasn't listed how many displays it supports at 4K 60 Hz. It's within your budget, has two video outputs and delivers 90 W, but I can't confirm it fits your setup. This is the spec the store is missing.\n- **Demo Dock Duo Lite ($89.00):** It's incompatible. It supports only one display at 4K 60 Hz.\n- **Demo Dock Travel and Demo Dock Solo:** Their listed specs show they support only one 4K 60 Hz display, so the store didn't check them.\n\nYou have two options:\n1. Get the store to confirm the Duo's 4K 60 Hz display count. If it's 2, I can ask for a quote.\n2. Accept one 4K 60 Hz display, with the second at a lower resolution or refresh rate. The Duo Lite could work then, but I'd have to check it against your requirements first."
    }
